# Campus GEM Frontend Rules

- Prefer Server Components; add `"use client"` only for interactivity/motion.
- Follow Atomic Design: atoms → molecules → organisms → sections → templates.
- Keep repeated content in `src/constants/` — do not hardcode lists in JSX.
- Use design tokens from `globals.css` / Tailwind theme; avoid one-off colors and spacing.
- Use `next/image` and `next/font`.
- Motion must use shared variants in `src/lib/motion.ts` and respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Maintain accessibility: semantic landmarks, focus states, keyboard nav, meaningful alt text.
- Homepage quality bar first; do not sprawl unfinished secondary pages.
